    - You are almost there, one more my friend.
    speakerNames: []
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - Oh breadcrums! You found all of my babies.
    - I'm so happy, take this.
    speakerNames: []
  - speakerName: Maria
    sentences:
    - Thank you again little hero.
